{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006 ($4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 to $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006).","value":6,"unit":"USD_million","result_id":"tool:1","sources":["source:q11n3","source:q11n4"],"calculation":"reserve_2006 ($10 million) - reserve_2005 ($4 million) = $6 million"}}